{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622990/extras/5b5dce1540fbc3f8f3021f8e7ddde9a1.poster.avif?t=1759249848\" width=1170 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622990/extras/5b5dce1540fbc3f8f3021f8e7ddde9a1.webm?t=1759249848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622990/extras/5b5dce1540fbc3f8f3021f8e7ddde9a1.mp4?t=1759249848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622990/extras/732d55f3c04edb9a2610afe60ff9d376.avif?t=1759249848\" width=780 height=265 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>SkyRanch.Life</strong> is a beautiful Dating Sim RPG Visual Novel with Vampires, Elves, Furries, Monsters, and Gods know what else \u271d\ufe0f </i>\u2014Us</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game combines Dating, Visual Novel, and RPG gameplay in a Sci-Fi Fantasy setting to tell the character's story influenced by player's choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Date</strong>\u00a0Elves, Monsters, Furries, Yourself, and who knows what else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong>\u00a0\ud83d\uddfb\ud83d\udc40 and <strong>fight \u2694\ufe0f</strong> your way through dungeons to save or plunder whoever or whatever the fuck is after the last boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622990/extras/screenshot-05.jpg?t=1759249848\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622990/extras/screenshot-08.jpg?t=1759249848\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first playable character is <strong>Vleed S\u00e2ngerel</strong>, a vampire socially unadjusted for spatial travel. He has been yeeted off his homeland for biting the wrong butt at the wrong time and now he has to pretend to be normal because <i>It's just easier for the common folk to understand.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your <strong>Vampiric Powers</strong> to get stuff done, but beware of the Crime system (Chaos). Some of these powers allow you to quickly progress through parts of the game, but it all comes at a cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622990/extras/3abb4416baf1e50f5aaafc8c7f7ea2a3.avif?t=1759249848\" width=1080 height=1080 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Ranch Plot - Future Plans \ud83d\udcc5</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622990/extras/vleed-angry-with-vegetables-01.png?t=1759249848\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In SkyRanch you will be able to acquire various Ranch Plots where you can hoard your loot and other possessions, grow stuff, and keep some friendly farm &quot;animals.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you personally might not enjoy digging in the dirt and planting seeds, the produce you grow can be used for crafting / cooking / bribing and to keep your cowgirls and bullboys fed and happy. And you can never be too sure when you'll need a handy potion to <i>largely</i> enhance your adventuring experience \ud83d\ude09.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're feeling fancy and do not wish to sleep with the open universe above your head, build a house that can be used and abused at your leisure.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh and ... before you bring any of the locals home ... you might want to furnish the place to not look like a traveling serial killer \ud83d\ude28.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622990/extras/platform-01.png?t=1759249848\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unfurnished Business</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622990/extras/38379949a7a67be9b6e62e9b052db002.poster.avif?t=1759249848\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622990/extras/38379949a7a67be9b6e62e9b052db002.webm?t=1759249848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622990/extras/38379949a7a67be9b6e62e9b052db002.mp4?t=1759249848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features current and soon-to-be \ud83e\udd14</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vampire Story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vampiric Powers unlocking vampire specific interactions and possibilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse dialogue choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple interactable and diverse characters to date</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RPG elements: stats, dice rolling - these influence your actions / dialogue choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pets that follow and help you in your adventures</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fancy moves and combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open world exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Housing: from coffin to castle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranch interactions with your ranch-girls and ranch-guys</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >We hope you have fun with it \ud83e\udd73!</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3622990?t=1759249848","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622990/f6f1f44381fc4ffea3adac187aa4dee568776b2d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759249848","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622990/8e11f15a48c09ac5c63dcdc4382fe47270975e2b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759249848","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622990/8e11f15a48c09ac5c63dcdc4382fe47270975e2b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759249848","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"Nudity is involved but no depiction of genitalia.\r\nNo sex, only consensual buttocks massage meant to tenderize the area for the vampire's attack. Non-consensual buttocks biting which is punished."},"demos":[{"appid":4010660,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622990/extras/5b5dce1540fbc3f8f3021f8e7ddde9a1.poster.avif?t=1759249848\" width=1170 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622990/extras/5b5dce1540fbc3f8f3021f8e7ddde9a1.webm?t=1759249848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622990/extras/5b5dce1540fbc3f8f3021f8e7ddde9a1.mp4?t=175924984