llow you to quickly progress through parts of the game, but it all comes at a cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622990/extras/3abb4416baf1e50f5aaafc8c7f7ea2a3.avif?t=1759249848\" width=1080 height=1080 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Ranch Plot - Future Plans \ud83d\udcc5</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622990/extras/vleed-angry-with-vegetables-01.png?t=1759249848\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In SkyRanch you will be able to acquire various Ranch Plots where you can hoard your loot and other possessions, grow stuff, and keep some friendly farm &quot;animals.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you personally might not enjoy digging in the dirt and planting seeds, the produce you grow can be used for crafting / cooking / bribing and to keep your cowgirls and bullboys fed and happy. And you can never be too sure when you'll need a handy potion to <i>largely</i> enhance your adventuring experience \ud83d\ude09.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're feeling fancy and do not wish to sleep with the open universe above your head, build a house that can be used and abused at your leisure.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh and ... before you bring any of the locals home ... you might want to furnish the place to not look like a traveling serial killer \ud83d\ude28.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622990/extras/platform-01.png?t=1759249848\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unfurnished Business</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622990/extras/38379949a7a67be9b6e62e9b052db002.poster.avif?t=1759249848\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622990/extras/38379949a7a67be9b6e62e9b052db002.webm?t=1759249848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622990/extras/38379949a7a67be9b6e62e9b052db002.mp4?t=1759249848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features current and soon-to-be \ud83e\udd14</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vampire Story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vampiric Powers unlocking vampire specific interactions and possibilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse dialogue choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple interactable and diverse characters to date</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RPG elements: stats, dice rolling - these influence your actions / dialogue choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pets that follow and help you in your adventures</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fancy moves and combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open world exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Housing: from coffin to castle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranch interactions with your ranch-girls and ranch-guys</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >We hope you have fun with it \ud83e\udd73!</h2>","developers":["Smol Spaghettorium"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://